      "html": "<div data-v-d1e1d890><section id=\"section-dpa-hero\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative justify-center min-h-viewport-min max-md:min-h-viewport-stable-min pb-24 max-md:pb-10 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding pointer-events-auto\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:6rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:2.5rem;\" data-v-d1e1d890 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-8\" data-v-d1e1d890><div class=\"max-w-4xl flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-d1e1d890><h1 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-5xl max-md:leading-none max-md:tracking-display text-6xl\" data-v-d1e1d890><span class=\"block text-spark\">Digital product agency</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">Products people use.</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">Built AI-native.</span></h1></div><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight max-w-6xl text-slatecolor\" data-v-d1e1d890>A London digital product development agency for scale-ups and enterprises. Strategy, design, and engineering in small senior squads - shipping working software from the first sprint.</p><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"pointer-events-auto self-start md:hidden\" data-v-d1e1d890><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full tracking-tight cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 ease-out text-center outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal border border-transparent text-chalk bg-slate-dark shadow-button hover:bg-portal-surface hover:text-chalk font-medium text-sm leading-normal py-3.5 px-5\"><span class=\"relative z-10\"><span data-v-d1e1d890>Contact</span></span></button></a></div></section></div>"
