      "html": "<section id=\"section-dpa-clients\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative items-center gap-20 pt-12 pb-32 max-md:pt-8 max-md:pb-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><h2 class=\"text-reveal-pending logo-strip-heading pointer-events-auto m-0 w-full max-md:hidden text-center text-3xl font-normal text-slatecolor\"><span class=\"text-reveal-word\">Trusted</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">by</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">ambitious</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">teams</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">to</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">build</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">products</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">people</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">use.</span></h2><ul class=\"logo-strip__grid pointer-events-auto grid w-full gap-3 logo-strip__grid--four\"><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/google-2015-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Google\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/youtube-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"YouTube\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/revolut-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Revolut\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/tesco-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Tesco\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/dataiku-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"dataiku\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/sage-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Sage\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/choreograph-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"choreograph\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/smartly-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"SMARTLY.IO\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li></ul></section>"
