    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human",
        "data-v-c2ba827a": ""
      },
      "html": "<section id=\"section-dpa-intro\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-24 max-md:py-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl\" data-v-c2ba827a><span class=\"block text-spark\">What we do</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">A London digital product development agency built for the AI era</span></h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--markdown flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p>Fyntix is a digital product development agency in London. We combine product strategy, design, and engineering to take digital products from idea to production: web and mobile applications, internal platforms, and enterprise software that people actually use. We hire the AI engineers, we manage them, and they work inside your team.</p>\n<p>Today, every digital product is becoming an AI product. We design and build AI-native from the start: intelligence in the core experience rather than bolted on, from agent-powered workflows to interfaces designed for both humans and AI agents. If your priority is automation or agent development specifically, see our <a href=\"/services/ai-agency\">AI agency services</a>. Explore our full <a href=\"/services\">AI consultancy &amp; product development services</a>. For a market view of who builds AI products at enterprise scale, see <a href=\"/feed/top-ai-product-agencies-for-enterprises-2026\">top AI product agencies for enterprises</a>. New to the category? Our guide explains <a href=\"/feed/what-is-a-digital-product-agency\">what a digital product agency is and what it does</a>.</p>\n<p>We work as small, senior, embedded squads - strategy, design, and engineering in one team, shipping working software from the first sprint.</p>\n</div></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human"
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden bg-chalk\"><section id=\"section-dpa-pillars\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-40 pt-40 pb-20 max-md:pt-20 max-md:pb-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><h2 class=\"font-normal text-5xl\"><span class=\"text-spark\">Digital product development</span><br><span class=\"text-slatecolor\">What a London digital product agency delivers - strategy, design, and engineering from discovery through to production.</span></h2><div class=\"grid-cols-3 grid w-full max-md:grid-cols-1 items-stretch max-md:gap-16 gap-24\"><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">Strategy</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Find the bets worth making.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Product discovery, roadmaps, and rapid proofs of concept. We align stakeholders, explore the problem space, and validate value before you scale investment.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/sage-logo-evidence.gen.webp\" alt=\"Sage\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We defined &amp; piloted a creative intelligence agent with Sage to drive ads ROI.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">Design</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Experiences people want to use.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">UX and UI design, design systems, and content - human-centred interfaces built for real workflows, including products designed for both humans and AI agents.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/tesco-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Tesco\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We built an AI-native creative studio that took Tesco's retail ads from four-week approvals to days.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">Engineering</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Ship products that scale.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Web and mobile applications, internal platforms, and agent systems - built by embedded squads who ship working software from the first sprint.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/_nuxt/google-cloud-evidence._xZJoMAR.svg\" alt=\"Google Cloud\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We uncovered sales opportunities for 5,000 Googlers with an agentic sales system.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human",
        "data-v-be4afccd": ""
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-chalk\" data-v-be4afccd><section id=\"section-dpa-faq\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-be4afccd data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-12\" data-v-be4afccd><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\" data-v-be4afccd><h2 class=\"font-normal text-5xl\" data-v-be4afccd><span class=\"text-spark\">Digital product agency FAQs</span></h2><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-xl leading-snug tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd>Straight answers for teams evaluating a digital product agency in London.</p></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-be4afccd><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What is a digital product agency? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>A digital product agency designs, builds, and scales software products - web and mobile apps, platforms, and digital services. Unlike a marketing or branding agency, its core output is working software; unlike a pure development shop, it combines product strategy and design with engineering. The best digital product agencies now build AI-native products by default.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What does a digital product agency do? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Typical work spans product strategy and discovery, UX and UI design, engineering, and ongoing iteration after launch. At Fyntix that includes rapid proofs of concept, full product builds, and embedding AI capabilities such as agents and automation into existing products.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How is Fyntix different from other digital product agencies? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>We're AI-native. Every product we ship is designed for the era of intelligent software - backed by delivery experience spanning scale-ups and enterprises: Google, Tesco, Sage, Revolut, and Upstix. Small senior squads, startup pace, production quality.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Can your engineers work inside our team? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Yes. We hire and manage them, and they work embedded with your people.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What is the difference between a digital product agency and a development shop? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>A development shop focuses on writing code to a specification. A digital product agency owns the full product lifecycle - strategy, discovery, UX and UI design, engineering, and iteration after launch. You get senior practitioners who challenge assumptions and ship products people use, not just features on a backlog.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Do you work with scale-ups as well as enterprises? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Yes. We work with ambitious scale-ups and global enterprises - from Upstix and Revolut to Google and Tesco. The engagement model adapts to your stage: discovery sprints and proofs of concept for early bets, embedded product squads for full builds.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How much does a digital product agency cost? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>It depends on scope and engagement model. We typically start with a fixed-scope discovery or proof of concept to validate value before a larger build, then move to an embedded product squad for delivery. Get in touch for a scoped estimate.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How do I choose a digital product agency in London? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Look at shipped products rather than showreels: ask who will actually work on your product, how fast they get working software in front of users, and how they handle AI capability. Then start small - a discovery sprint or proof of concept reveals more than any pitch.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What should I look for in a digital product agency? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Prioritise teams with shipped product evidence, senior practitioners on the work (not a pitch team), a clear discovery or proof-of-concept entry point, and experience embedding AI into products - not just adding a chatbot. Strong digital product agencies combine strategy, UX and UI design, and engineering in one squad.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Where is your digital product agency in London based? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Our HQ is in Southwark, London - The Binary, 27 Copperfield Street, SE1 0EN. We work with clients across the UK and internationally, from scale-ups to global enterprises.</span></div></details></div></div></section></div>"
    },
